  qrCodeID: "De\u015Farj \xC7ubu\u011Fu (Topraklama Ma\u015Fas\u0131)"
  title: "De\u015Farj \xC7ubu\u011Fu (Topraklama Ma\u015Fas\u0131)"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "De\u015Farj \xE7ubu\u011Fu, a\xE7\u0131k sistemlerde y\xFCksek gerilim
    testleri tamamland\u0131ktan sonra kabloda veya ekipman \xFCzerinde kalabilecek
    kapasitif elektrik y\xFCk\xFCn\xFC g\xFCvenli \u015Fekilde topra\u011Fa bo\u015Faltmak
    i\xE7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Test sonras\u0131nda olu\u015Fabilecek art\u0131k
    gerilimin kontroll\xFC olarak de\u015Farj edilmesini sa\u011Flayarak personelin
    ve ekipmanlar\u0131n elektriksel risklere kar\u015F\u0131 korunmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131
    olur. Y\xFCksek gerilimle \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131lan t\xFCm a\xE7\u0131k sistem
    uygulamalar\u0131nda \xF6nemli bir g\xFCvenlik ekipman\u0131d\u0131r."
